Community-based organizations";s:19:"international_title";s:22:"International Partners";s:13:"international";a:9:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:25:"World-Food-Programme.webp";s:4:"name";s:20:"World Food Programme";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:15:"OPM-Logo-1.webp";s:4:"name";s:24:"Oxford Policy Management";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:12:"UN-Logo.webp";s:4:"name";s:14:"United Nations";}i:3;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:21:"FCDO-Office-Logo.webp";s:4:"name";s:7:"UK FCDO";}i:4;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:16:"Unicef-Logo.webp";s:4:"name";s:6:"UNICEF";}i:5;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:13:"IGSI-V02.webp";s:4:"name";s:4:"IGSI";}i:6;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:15:"USAID-Logo.webp";s:4:"name";s:5:"USAID";}i:7;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:27:"World-Food-Forum-Youth.webp";s:4:"name";s:16:"World Food Forum";}i:8;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:16:"FAO-UN-Logo.webp";s:4:"name";s:3:"FAO";}}s:14:"national_title";s:17:"National Partners";s:8:"national";a:6:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:30:"Alkhidmat-Foundation-Logo.webp";s:4:"name";s:20:"Alkhidmat Foundation";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:31:"Govenment-of-Pakistan-Logo.webp";s:4:"name";s:22:"Government of Pakistan";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:25:"Edhi-Foundation-Logo.webp";s:4:"name";s:15:"Edhi Foundation";}i:3;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:8:"BISP.png";s:4:"name";s:4:"BISP";}i:4;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:14:"PRCS-Logo.webp";s:4:"name";s:29:"Pakistan Red Crescent Society";}i:5;a:2:{s:5:"image";s:21:"President-Office.webp";s:4:"name";s:20:"President’s Office";}}}s:3:"why";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:29:"Why Organizations Choose GODC";s:5:"title";s:61:"Technical expertise with practical implementation experience.";s:4:"text";s:411:"Organizations partner with GODC because we combine technical expertise with practical implementation experience and a commitment to delivering measurable results.

Our work is guided by collaboration, integrity, innovation, and evidence-based practice. We believe successful partnerships are built on trust, shared goals, and solutions that create lasting value for organizations and the communities they serve.";}s:3:"cta";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:42:"Let’s Create Sustainable Impact Together";s:5:"title";s:48:"Meaningful, measurable, and sustainable results.";s:4:"text";s:224:"Whether you are strengthening a health system, developing policy, managing a complex program, or building organizational capacity, GODC is ready to partner with you to achieve meaningful, measurable, and sustainable results.";}s:7:"enquiry";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:39:"Contact Us to Discuss Your Requirements";s:4:"form";s:14:"global-enquiry";}}s:34:"aa4d0f55c8d3ad675ca362eded191382sc";a:9:{s:5:"title";s:27:"Obesity & Bariatric Surgery";s:7:"summary";s:87:"Understand obesity and explore management, non-surgical and surgical treatment options.";s:9:"nav_group";s:35:"Surgical, Bariatric & Diabetes Care";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:153:"Obesity care in Lahore: learn about obesity, its management and treatment options, from diet changes to bariatric surgery, with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani.";s:8:"keywords";s:95:"obesity treatment Lahore, bariatric surgeon Lahore, weight loss surgery, Prof Dr Mohsin Gillani";}s:4:"hero";a:4:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:7:"Obesity";s:4:"lead";s:87:"Understand obesity and explore management, non-surgical and surgical treatment options.";s:5:"image";s:18:"New-Project-41.jpg";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}s:10:"card_image";s:18:"New-Project-41.jpg";}s:34:"dbb2ab4af8504921c95f2df0d302a0b0sc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:17:"Obesity Treatment";s:7:"summary";s:101:"From diet and lifestyle modification to advanced procedures, find the treatment that fits your needs.";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:158:"Obesity treatment options in Lahore: diet and lifestyle modification, Plenity capsule, gastric balloon, laser liposuction, weight-loss injections and tablets.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:17:"Obesity Treatment";s:4:"lead";s:101:"From diet and lifestyle modification to advanced procedures, find the treatment that fits your needs.";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"891eb555065022c265496dbf88bc4d6csc";a:8:{s:5:"title";s:21:"Non-Surgical Approach";s:7:"summary";s:81:"Diet, exercise and medication: how weight can be controlled without an operation.";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:145:"Non-surgical weight-loss approaches in Lahore: adjustment diets, regular physical exercise and medication, explained by Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:21:"Non-Surgical Approach";s:4:"lead";s:81:"Diet, exercise and medication: how weight can be controlled without an operation.";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}s:10:"card_image";s:21:"New-Project-19-2.webp";}s:34:"139bc3935c659f84d1c5b9dc3c34cbddsc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:17:"Surgical Approach";s:7:"summary";s:118:"Many studies show that a surgical intervention offers the highest chance of success four patients with morbid obesity.";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:146:"Weight-loss (bariatric) surgery in Lahore offers the highest chance of lasting success for morbid obesity. Explore the types of surgery available.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:17:"Surgical Approach";s:4:"lead";s:118:"Many studies show that a surgical intervention offers the highest chance of success four patients with morbid obesity.";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"05b5e69e0088aa6db182f1fe77773a3asc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:19:"Mini-Gastric Bypass";s:7:"summary";s:115:"The Omega Loop (single anastomosis) gastric bypass combines restriction and malabsorption, and is fully reversible.";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:140:"Mini-gastric bypass (Omega Loop / single anastomosis) in Lahore: a reversible weight-loss operation combining restriction and malabsorption.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:19:"Mini-Gastric Bypass";s:4:"lead";s:115:"The Omega Loop (single anastomosis) gastric bypass combines restriction and malabsorption, and is fully reversible.";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"8cbe4fd0081c29b30b845245817b80e5sc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:21:"Endoscopic Ballooning";s:7:"summary";s:93:"A temporary, reversible gastric balloon placed through endoscopy, with no surgical incisions.";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:157:"Endoscopic gastric balloon in Lahore: a temporary, reversible, incision-free procedure that creates early fullness and helps weight loss. Learn how it works.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:21:"Endoscopic Ballooning";s:4:"lead";s:93:"A temporary, reversible gastric balloon placed through endoscopy, with no surgical incisions.";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"b75ca4aeb43cd98320e5c631b52525a6sc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:15:"Gastric Banding";s:7:"summary";s:90:"An adjustable silicone band placed around the upper stomach to limit how much you can eat.";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:146:"Adjustable gastric banding (lap band) in Lahore: how it works, expected loss of 50-60% of excess weight, and the possible risks and complications.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:15:"Gastric Banding";s:4:"lead";s:90:"An adjustable silicone band placed around the upper stomach to limit how much you can eat.";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"ef45c156f31c589311406940c0faf0c7sc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:32:"Sleeve Gastrectomy (Restrictive)";s:7:"summary";s:81:"Laparoscopic sleeve gastrectomy, the most commonly performed weight-loss surgery.";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:142:"Laparoscopic sleeve gastrectomy in Lahore: the most common bariatric surgery, removing 60-85% of the stomach to reduce hunger and food intake.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:34:"Restrictive – Sleeve Gastrectomy";s:4:"lead";s:81:"Laparoscopic sleeve gastrectomy, the most commonly performed weight-loss surgery.";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"3ea3e3781359ab45acbf9497c185536dsc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:24:"Roux-En-Y Gastric Bypass";s:7:"summary";s:96:"Considered the gold standard of modern obesity surgery, combining restriction and malabsorption.";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:149:"Laparoscopic Roux-En-Y gastric bypass in Lahore, the gold standard of obesity surgery: how it works, what happens during surgery, and what to expect.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:24:"Roux-En-Y Gastric Bypass";s:4:"lead";s:96:"Considered the gold standard of modern obesity surgery, combining restriction and malabsorption.";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"359b11c456862220b5ee219819d07153sc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:18:"Obesity Management";s:7:"summary";s:101:"Surgical, medical and non-surgical options to manage obesity, treat its complications and prevent it.";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:134:"Comprehensive obesity management in Lahore: surgical, medical and device-based options, treating complications and preventing obesity.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:18:"Obesity Management";s:4:"lead";s:101:"Surgical, medical and non-surgical options to manage obesity, treat its complications and prevent it.";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"b204d4017a1a5c5c712cebb43a7c3da5sc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:13:"About Obesity";s:7:"summary";s:118:"Obesity is a chronic and severe condition of overweight. Here is how it is measured and what it means for your health.";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:154:"What is obesity? Learn how BMI is measured, what morbid obesity means and its physical and psychological health effects. Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani, Lahore.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:13:"About Obesity";s:4:"lead";s:118:"Obesity is a chronic and severe condition of overweight. Here is how it is measured and what it means for your health.";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"5190ec46decd61be5f4d0252816c4f83sc";a:13:{s:5:"title";s:37:"Geriatric & Palliative Care Nutrition";s:7:"summary";s:78:"Compassionate nutrition for frailty, cachexia, dysphagia and end-of-life care.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:163:"Geriatric and palliative care nutrition: frailty, malnutrition, cachexia, dysphagia and end-of-life nutritional support delivered with dignity by GODC specialists.";s:8:"keywords";s:108:"geriatric nutrition, palliative care nutrition, dysphagia management, frailty malnutrition, cachexia support";}s:4:"hero";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:37:"Geriatric & Palliative Care Nutrition";s:5:"intro";s:374:"Older adults and individuals with serious illnesses often have unique nutritional needs. We provide personalized nutrition support for frailty, dementia, cancer-related weight loss, and palliative care. Our focus is on maintaining nutritional status, supporting strength and comfort, and improving quality of life while considering the needs of both patients and caregivers.";}s:5:"signs";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:52:"Early Signs of Geriatric & Palliative Care Nutrition";s:4:"text";s:714:"Changes in nutritional needs often begin with a reduced appetite, unexplained weight loss, fatigue, or difficulty eating. Older adults and individuals with chronic illnesses may also experience muscle weakness, dehydration, or poor energy levels.

Some people may find it difficult to chew or swallow food, while others may struggle to maintain a balanced diet due to illness or medication side effects. These changes can affect overall health, recovery, and daily functioning.

Recognizing these early signs and seeking professional nutritional support can help prevent malnutrition and improve quality of life. A personalized nutrition plan can promote comfort, maintain strength, and support overall well-being.";s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:"image";s:16:"nutrition-3.jpeg";}}}s:3:"cta";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a Consultation with our Nutrition Specialist";s:4:"text";s:342:"Our experienced nutrition specialists provide personalized dietary guidance for older adults and individuals receiving palliative care. We create tailored nutrition plans to support strength, manage symptoms, improve comfort, and enhance overall quality of life. Book your consultation today to receive compassionate, expert nutritional care.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";}s:6:"causes";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:47:"Causes of Geriatric & Palliative Care Nutrition";s:5:"intro";s:439:"The need for geriatric and palliative nutrition support can arise from aging, chronic illnesses, cancer, neurological conditions, or other serious health issues that affect eating and nutrient absorption. Reduced appetite, swallowing difficulties, and increased nutritional requirements can also contribute to poor nutritional status. Early nutritional intervention helps maintain strength, improve comfort, and support overall well-being.";s:5:"items";a:3:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:19:"Age-Related Changes";s:4:"text";s:192:"As people age, their metabolism, appetite, and ability to absorb nutrients naturally decline. These changes can increase the risk of malnutrition and make proper nutritional support essential.";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:17:"Chronic Illnesses";s:4:"text";s:234:"Conditions such as cancer, heart disease, kidney disease, and neurological disorders can affect appetite, digestion, and the body’s nutritional needs. A personalized nutrition plan helps support recovery and improve quality of life.";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:30:"Difficulty Eating & Swallowing";s:4:"text";s:190:"Problems with chewing, swallowing, or digestion can make it challenging to consume enough nutrients. Specialized dietary guidance can help ensure safe eating and adequate nutritional intake.";}}}s:10:"conditions";a:4:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:34:"Frailty & Age-related Malnutrition";s:4:"text";s:475:"Our nutrition care for older adults focuses on preventing and managing malnutrition, maintaining strength, and supporting healthy aging. We create personalized nutrition plans based on appetite, medical conditions, mobility, food preferences, and individual nutritional needs.

We focus on adequate protein, calories, hydration, and essential nutrients to help maintain muscle strength and overall well-being. Our goal is to support independence, energy, and quality of life.";s:5:"image";s:13:"Frailty-1.jpg";}i:1;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:8:"Cachexia";s:4:"text";s:468:"Our nutrition support for cachexia focuses on maintaining nutritional status, strength, and comfort in patients experiencing significant weight and muscle loss. Plans are tailored to the patient’s medical condition, appetite, symptoms, and individual needs.

We focus on nutrient-dense foods, adequate protein and energy, hydration, and practical meal strategies. The aim is to support strength, comfort, and quality of life rather than focusing only on weight gain.";s:5:"image";s:13:"cachexia.jpeg";}i:2;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:31:"End-of-life Nutritional Support";s:4:"text";s:450:"Our end-of-life nutrition care focuses on comfort, dignity, and the individual wishes of the patient. Nutrition and hydration recommendations are personalized according to the patient’s condition, symptoms, preferences, and goals of care.

We provide compassionate guidance to patients and families regarding appropriate food, fluids, and feeding approaches. The focus is on comfort and quality of life rather than unnecessary dietary restrictions.";s:5:"image";s:24:"nutritional-support.jpeg";}i:3;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:20:"Dysphagia Management";s:4:"text";s:458:"Our nutrition care for dysphagia focuses on helping patients meet their nutritional and hydration needs while supporting safer and more comfortable eating. We tailor food textures, meal consistency, and nutritional choices according to individual swallowing needs.

We also focus on maintaining adequate calories, protein, and fluids while making meals practical and enjoyable. Our goal is to support nutritional health, comfort, and overall quality of life.";s:5:"image";s:13:"dysphaia.jpeg";}}s:5:"risks";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:65:"What increases the risk of Geriatric & Palliative Care Nutrition?";s:5:"intro";s:501:"Several factors can increase the risk of poor nutrition in older adults and individuals receiving palliative care, including advanced age, chronic illnesses, reduced appetite, difficulty chewing or swallowing, medication side effects, and limited mobility.

Understanding these risk factors allows for early nutritional intervention and better health outcomes. Personalized dietary support can help prevent malnutrition, improve energy levels, manage symptoms, and enhance comfort and quality of life.";s:5:"items";a:2:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:26:"Chronic Medical Conditions";s:4:"text";s:246:"Long-term illnesses such as cancer, dementia, kidney disease, and heart disease can increase the body’s nutritional needs while reducing appetite and food intake. Proper nutritional care helps support strength, recovery, and overall well-being.";s:3:"why";s:227:"At GODC, our nutrition specialists create individualized meal plans based on each patient’s age, medical condition, and nutritional needs. This personalized approach helps improve health, comfort, and overall quality of life.";}i:1;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:42:"Reduced Appetite & Swallowing Difficulties";s:4:"text";s:239:"Aging, illness, and certain medications can lead to poor appetite or difficulty chewing and swallowing. These challenges may result in inadequate nutrition, making early dietary support essential for maintaining health and quality of life.";s:3:"why";s:173:"GODC provides evidence-based nutritional guidance with a patient-centered approach. Our experienced team works closely with patients and families to deliver ongoing support.";}}}s:4:"when";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:35:"When to see a Nutrition Specialist?";s:4:"text";s:419:"If you or a loved one is experiencing unexplained weight loss, poor appetite, difficulty chewing or swallowing, fatigue, or nutritional deficiencies, it is important to consult a nutrition specialist. Early nutritional assessment can help prevent malnutrition, support recovery, and improve overall health and quality of life. Personalized dietary guidance ensures that nutritional needs are met at every stage of care.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";}s:9:"diagnosis";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:55:"How is Geriatric & Palliative Care Nutrition Diagnosed?";s:5:"intro";s:472:"Geriatric and palliative care nutrition is assessed through a comprehensive evaluation of a patient’s medical history, dietary habits, weight changes, symptoms, and overall nutritional status. A nutrition specialist may also review laboratory results, physical health, and underlying medical conditions to identify nutritional deficiencies or risks. This assessment helps create a personalized nutrition plan that supports comfort, strength, and overall quality of life.";s:7:"columns";a:3:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:6:"Causes";s:5:"intro";s:36:"Common contributing factors include:";s:5:"items";s:85:"Aging
Chronic illnesses
Poor appetite
Swallowing difficulties
Medication side effects";}i:1;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:9:"Treatment";s:5:"intro";s:72:"If symptoms are mild, your clinician may advise simple measures such as:";s:5:"items";s:106:"Personalized meal plans
Oral nutrition supplements
Symptom management
Hydration support
Swallowing therapy";}i:2;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:15:"Predispositions";s:5:"intro";s:38:"You may be at higher risk if you have:";s:5:"items";s:70:"Advanced age
Cancer
Dementia
Reduced mobility
Long-term medication use";}}}s:9:"nav_group";s:27:"Clinical Nutrition Services";s:10:"card_image";s:16:"nutrition-3.jpeg";}s:34:"bbc238dabe39bd5507c9de1346cec9dbsc";a:10:{s:5:"title";s:57:"ALCOS – Advanced Laparoscopic, Cancer & Obesity Surgery";s:4:"menu";s:20:"ALCOS Surgery Centre";s:7:"summary";s:97:"Advanced Laparoscopic Cancer & Obesity Surgery: the only specialist centre of its kind in Lahore.";s:9:"nav_group";s:35:"Surgical, Bariatric & Diabetes Care";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:145:"ALCOS, the Advanced Laparoscopic Cancer & Obesity Surgery centre in Lahore: laparoscopic, cancer and obesity surgery by a multidisciplinary team.";s:8:"keywords";s:99:"advanced laparoscopic surgery Lahore, cancer surgery, ALCOS Iqra Medical Complex, bariatric surgery";}s:4:"hero";a:4:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:5:"ALCOS";s:4:"lead";s:97:"Advanced Laparoscopic Cancer & Obesity Surgery: the only specialist centre of its kind in Lahore.";s:5:"image";s:18:"New-Project-39.jpg";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}s:10:"card_image";s:18:"New-Project-39.jpg";}s:34:"6d72c3f664efe802e70d683351f9857dsc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:29:"Advanced Laparoscopic Surgery";s:7:"summary";s:83:"Minimally invasive surgery with smaller incisions, less pain and a faster recovery.";s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:143:"Advanced laparoscopic (keyhole) surgery in Lahore: cholecystectomy, appendectomy, hernia repair, fundoplication and more, with faster recovery.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:29:"Advanced Laparoscopic Surgery";s:4:"lead";s:83:"Minimally invasive surgery with smaller incisions, less pain and a faster recovery.";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"d5962d64cabfebd0febd523f37ea2c8asc";a:13:{s:5:"title";s:23:"Cardiovascular Diseases";s:7:"summary";s:109:"Heart-focused nutrition, rehabilitation and risk-factor management for coronary, stroke and vascular disease.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:179:"Heart-healthy clinical nutrition for coronary artery disease, cardiac rehabilitation, stroke and peripheral vascular disease. Book a cardiovascular nutrition consultation at GODC.";s:8:"keywords";s:126:"cardiac nutrition Lahore, heart disease diet, coronary artery disease nutrition, stroke nutrition, cardiac rehabilitation diet";}s:4:"hero";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:23:"Cardiovascular Diseases";s:5:"intro";s:381:"Cardiovascular diseases are conditions that affect the heart and blood vessels, impacting the body’s ability to circulate blood efficiently. These disorders include coronary artery disease, heart failure, arrhythmias, and stroke-related conditions. Early diagnosis, healthy lifestyle choices, and timely treatment can help reduce complications and support long-term heart health.";}s:5:"signs";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:38:"Early Signs of Cardiovascular Diseases";s:4:"text";s:669:"Cardiovascular diseases often begin with mild symptoms that may be mistaken for everyday fatigue or stress. Early warning signs can include chest discomfort, shortness of breath, dizziness, or unusual tiredness during routine activities.

Some people may notice a rapid or irregular heartbeat, swelling in the legs or ankles, or pain that spreads to the arms, neck, jaw, or shoulders. These symptoms can develop gradually or appear suddenly.

Recognizing these early signs and seeking medical attention promptly can help prevent serious complications. Early diagnosis and appropriate treatment are essential for protecting heart health and improving long-term outcomes.";s:6:"images";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:"image";s:28:"cardiovascular-diseases.jpeg";}}}s:3:"cta";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a Consultation with our Nutrition Specialist";s:4:"text";s:350:"Take control of your heart health with expert care from our experienced cardiology specialist. We provide comprehensive evaluations, personalized treatment plans, and preventive guidance to help you manage cardiovascular conditions and improve your overall well-being. Schedule your consultation today and start your journey toward a healthier heart.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";}s:6:"causes";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:33:"Causes of Cardiovascular Diseases";s:5:"intro";s:353:"Cardiovascular diseases can develop due to a combination of genetic, lifestyle, and medical factors that affect the heart and blood vessels. Poor diet, physical inactivity, smoking, high blood pressure, and diabetes are among the most common causes. Identifying these risk factors early can help prevent complications and support long-term heart health.";s:5:"items";a:3:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:19:"High Blood Pressure";s:4:"text";s:233:"High blood pressure places extra strain on the heart and blood vessels, increasing the risk of heart disease and stroke. Managing blood pressure through medication and healthy lifestyle choices is essential for cardiovascular health.";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:19:"Unhealthy Lifestyle";s:4:"text";s:213:"Poor eating habits, lack of physical activity, smoking, and excessive alcohol consumption can damage the heart over time. Adopting healthy daily habits can significantly reduce the risk of cardiovascular diseases.";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:16:"High Cholesterol";s:4:"text";s:217:"High cholesterol can lead to the buildup of plaque inside the arteries, restricting blood flow to the heart. Regular health checkups, a balanced diet, and proper treatment can help maintain healthy cholesterol levels.";}}}s:10:"conditions";a:4:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:29:"Coronary Artery Disease (CAD)";s:4:"text";s:518:"Our nutrition care for Coronary Artery Disease focuses on supporting heart health through personalized dietary and lifestyle strategies. We consider your medical history, eating habits, weight, and cardiovascular risk factors when developing your nutrition plan.

We emphasize balanced meals, vegetables, fruits, whole grains, fiber-rich foods, and healthier fats while limiting excessive saturated fat, sodium, and highly processed foods. The goal is to support cardiovascular health and promote long-term well-being.";s:5:"image";s:17:"coronry-heart.jpg";}i:1;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:14:"Rehabilitation";s:4:"text";s:508:"Nutrition plays an important role during cardiovascular rehabilitation by supporting recovery, strength, energy, and overall heart health. We provide personalized nutrition guidance based on your medical condition, recovery stage, activity level, and individual nutritional needs.

Our approach focuses on balanced meals, adequate protein, essential nutrients, and heart-healthy food choices. We aim to support a healthy recovery while helping patients develop sustainable eating habits for long-term health.";s:5:"image";s:19:"rehabilitation.avif";}i:2;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:12:"Stroke (CVA)";s:4:"text";s:498:"Our nutrition care for stroke patients focuses on supporting recovery, maintaining adequate nutrition, and managing cardiovascular risk factors. Nutrition plans are personalized according to the patient’s condition, nutritional needs, swallowing concerns, and overall recovery goals.

We provide guidance on balanced meals, appropriate portions, hydration, and heart-healthy food choices. Our goal is to support nutritional status and promote healthier lifestyle habits during and after recovery.";s:5:"image";s:15:"stroke-cva.jpeg";}i:3;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:27:"Peripheral Vascular Disease";s:4:"text";s:515:"Our nutrition approach for Peripheral Vascular Disease focuses on supporting circulation and cardiovascular health through healthier dietary and lifestyle choices. We assess individual risk factors, eating patterns, weight, and existing medical conditions when creating a personalized plan.

We encourage nutrient-rich foods, fiber, healthy fats, and balanced meals while reducing excessive sodium, saturated fats, and highly processed foods. This approach supports overall vascular health and long-term well-being.";s:5:"image";s:32:"peripheral-diesease-patient.jpeg";}}s:5:"risks";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:51:"What increases the risk of Cardiovascular Diseases?";s:5:"intro";s:499:"Several factors can increase the risk of developing cardiovascular diseases, including high blood pressure, high cholesterol, diabetes, obesity, smoking, physical inactivity, unhealthy eating habits, and chronic stress. Family history and advancing age also play an important role in increasing the likelihood of heart-related conditions.

Understanding these risk factors and taking preventive measures can help protect your heart, reduce complications, and improve long-term cardiovascular health.";s:5:"items";a:2:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:14:"Family History";s:4:"text";s:218:"A family history of heart disease can increase your risk of developing cardiovascular conditions. While genetics cannot be changed, regular health screenings and preventive care can help reduce potential complications.";s:3:"why";s:145:"Our skilled cardiology team provides accurate diagnosis and personalized treatment plans to help you achieve better heart health with confidence.";}i:1;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:21:"Poor Lifestyle Habits";s:4:"text";s:238:"Smoking, unhealthy eating, lack of exercise, excessive alcohol use, and chronic stress can significantly impact heart health. Making healthier lifestyle choices can lower the risk of cardiovascular diseases and improve overall well-being.";s:3:"why";s:136:"GODC combines modern diagnostic technology with compassionate care to deliver effective treatment and long-term cardiovascular wellness.";}}}s:4:"when";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:35:"When to see a Nutrition Specialist?";s:4:"text";s:307:"If you experience chest pain, shortness of breath, irregular heartbeat, dizziness, swelling in the legs, or unexplained fatigue, it is important to consult a cardiologist. Early evaluation can help detect heart conditions, prevent complications, and ensure timely treatment for better cardiovascular health.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";}s:9:"diagnosis";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:42:"How Are Cardiovascular Diseases Diagnosed?";s:5:"intro";s:393:"Diagnosing cardiovascular diseases begins with a detailed review of your medical history, symptoms, and a physical examination. Your doctor may recommend diagnostic tests such as blood tests, electrocardiograms (ECG), echocardiograms, or cardiac imaging to assess heart function. Early and accurate diagnosis helps guide effective treatment and reduces the risk of serious heart complications.";s:7:"columns";a:3:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:6:"Causes";s:5:"intro";s:36:"Common contributing factors include:";s:5:"items";s:81:"High blood pressure
High cholesterol
Diabetes
Smoking
Obesity
Physical inactivity";}i:1;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:9:"Treatment";s:5:"intro";s:72:"If symptoms are mild, your clinician may advise simple measures such as:";s:5:"items";s:121:"Prescription medications
Lifestyle changes
Heart-healthy diet
Regular exercise
Cardiac rehabilitation
Surgical procedures";}i:2;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:15:"Predispositions";s:5:"intro";s:38:"You may be at higher risk if you have:";s:5:"items";s:69:"Family history
Older age
Obesity
Chronic stress
Excessive alcohol use";}}}s:9:"nav_group";s:27:"Clinical Nutrition Services";s:10:"card_image";s:28:"cardiovascular-diseases.jpeg";}s:34:"11077cb79a481450991f2872bda31ba9sc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:7:"Sitemap";s:7:"visible";b:0;s:8:"routable";b:1;s:6:"robots";s:7:"noindex";s:12:"cache_enable";b:1;s:7:"sitemap";a:1:{s:6:"ignore";b:1;}s:7:"content";a:1:{s:5:"order";a:1:{s:2:"by";s:7:"default";}}}s:34:"f28e941e77d0fc921e8a9c3421abec20sc";a:9:{s:5:"title";s:10:"Contact Us";s:4:"menu";s:10:"Contact Us";s:9:"seo_title";s:34:"Book a Consultation | GODC, Lahore";s:7:"summary";s:41:"Book a consultation or ask us a question.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:122:"Book a consultation with GODC in Gulberg II, Lahore. Call, email or send a request for an in-person or online appointment.";s:8:"keywords";s:101:"book consultation Lahore, GODC contact, lifestyle medicine appointment, clinical nutritionist Gulberg";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:10:"Contact Us";s:5:"title";s:12:"Get in Touch";s:4:"text";s:42:"Contact GODC for any questions or queries.";}s:8:"form_ref";s:12:"consultation";s:7:"details";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:15:"Contact Details";s:4:"text";s:77:"If you face any issue while booking, contact our support team for assistance.";}s:11:"hours_title";s:13:"Opening Hours";}s:34:"3cb332df2024a18d118240060062ec12sc";a:5:{s:5:"title";s:8:"About Us";s:7:"summary";s:43:"Meet the people and principles behind GODC.";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:158:"About GODC – Gillani Obesity and Diabetes Clinic: our story, our values and the clinical leadership team behind evidence-based Lifestyle Medicine in Lahore.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:8:"About Us";s:5:"title";s:10:"Who we are";s:4:"text";s:138:"Gillani Obesity and Diabetes Clinic (GODC) is a healthcare clinic dedicated to improving health through evidence-based Lifestyle Medicine.";}s:14:"children_title";s:21:"Learn more about GODC";}s:34:"a88cf1ad0b7e18a166aa7b4dc8b8ab50sc";a:8:{s:5:"title";s:8:"Our Team";s:4:"menu";s:8:"Our Team";s:7:"summary";s:70:"Meet the professional team behind Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani’s clinic.";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:159:"Meet the doctors, surgeons, specialists and support staff at Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani’s obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery clinic in Lahore.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:8:"About Us";s:5:"title";s:8:"Our Team";s:4:"lead";s:70:"Meet the professional team behind Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani’s clinic.";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:6:"doctor";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:19:"Book an appointment";s:4:"text";s:51:"Our team is here to help you every step of the way.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"44e975e2d4ff372a9c132712af01e38csc";a:11:{s:5:"title";s:10:"About GODC";s:7:"summary";s:97:"A healthcare consultancy dedicated to improving health through evidence-based Lifestyle Medicine.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:179:"Gillani Obesity and Diabetes Clinic is a Lahore healthcare consultancy delivering evidence-based Lifestyle Medicine. Meet our mission, vision, values and clinical leadership team.";s:8:"keywords";s:107:"about GODC, Dr Arooj Gillani, lifestyle medicine clinic Lahore, clinical nutrition team, mission and values";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:8:"About Us";s:5:"title";s:65:"Lasting health begins with addressing the root causes of disease.";s:5:"image";s:20:"Clinic-About-Us.webp";}s:3:"who";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:10:"Who We Are";s:5:"title";s:35:"Gillani Obesity and Diabetes Clinic";s:4:"text";s:857:"Gillani Obesity and Diabetes Clinic (GODC) is a healthcare clinic dedicated to improving health through evidence-based Lifestyle Medicine. We believe that lasting health begins with addressing the root causes of disease rather than simply treating symptoms. Our approach combines medical knowledge, scientific evidence, and personalized care to help individuals achieve sustainable improvements in their health and well-being.

We work closely with every patient to develop practical, individualized strategies that support disease prevention, chronic disease management, and healthier living. Our goal is to empower people with the knowledge, guidance, and support they need to make informed decisions about their health.

Our care is guided by professionalism, compassion, integrity, and a commitment to delivering high-quality, patient-centered services.";}s:7:"mission";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:11:"Our Mission";s:4:"text";s:282:"To improve health and quality of life through empirically supported Lifestyle Medicine by providing personalized, compassionate, and patient-centered care to empower individuals to prevent, manage, and, where possible, reverse chronic diseases through sustainable lifestyle changes.";}s:6:"vision";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:10:"Our Vision";s:4:"text";s:193:"To be a trusted leader in Lifestyle Medicine, recognized for advancing preventive healthcare and helping individuals and communities achieve healthier lives through science-based clinical care.";}s:6:"values";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:10:"Our Values";s:5:"items";a:6:{i:0;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:13:"Patient First";s:4:"text";s:98:"Every decision we make is centered on the health, safety, dignity, and well-being of our patients.";s:4:"icon";s:5:"heart";}i:1;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:23:"Evidence-Based Practice";s:4:"text";s:124:"We deliver care based on the latest scientific evidence, internationally recognized guidelines, and clinical best practices.";s:4:"icon";s:4:"book";}i:2;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:10:"Compassion";s:4:"text";s:103:"We treat every individual with empathy, respect, and understanding throughout their healthcare journey.";s:4:"icon";s:5:"smile";}i:3;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:10:"Excellence";s:4:"text";s:119:"We are committed to maintaining the highest standards of professionalism, clinical quality, and continuous improvement.";s:4:"icon";s:5:"award";}i:4;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:9:"Integrity";s:4:"text";s:98:"We uphold honesty, transparency, accountability, and ethical practice in every aspect of our work.";s:4:"icon";s:6:"shield";}i:5;a:3:{s:5:"title";s:13:"Collaboration";s:4:"text";s:139:"We believe better health outcomes are achieved through partnership between healthcare professionals, patients, families, and organizations.";s:4:"icon";s:5:"users";}}}s:4:"team";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:13:"Our Core Team";s:4:"text";s:104:"A multidisciplinary leadership team with international clinical, public health and nutrition experience.";s:7:"members";a:4:{i:0;a:5:{s:5:"image";s:45:"Dr-Arooj-Gillani-IHAM-Lifestyle-Medicine.webp";s:4:"role";s:29:"Chief Executive Officer (CEO)";s:4:"name";s:24:"Dr. Arooj Fatima Gillani";s:11:"credentials";s:66:"MBBS, M.Phil. Public Health Nutrition, F.C.P.S.-I (Anesthesiology)";s:12:"affiliations";s:54:"CMI, WHO, UNICEF, USAID, Aga Khan University Certified";}i:1;a:5:{s:5:"image";s:16:"Dr-Mubashir.webp";s:4:"role";s:33:"Director Planning and Development";s:4:"name";s:19:"Dr. Mubashir Sohail";s:11:"credentials";s:67:"Doctor of Clinical Nutrition, M.Phil. Human Nutrition and Dietetics";s:12:"affiliations";s:112:"Nutrition International, UNICEF, WHO, McKinsey & Company, Johns Hopkins University, Aga Khan University Hospital";}i:2;a:5:{s:5:"image";s:13:"Dr-Komal.webp";s:4:"role";s:26:"Director Clinical Services";s:4:"name";s:15:"Dr. Komal Zakir";s:11:"credentials";s:51:"BS (Hons) Clinical Nutrition, MS Clinical Nutrition";s:12:"affiliations";s:21:"WHO, UNICEF Certified";}i:3;a:5:{s:5:"image";s:13:"Dr-Ujala.webp";s:4:"role";s:19:"Director Operations";s:4:"name";s:15:"Dr. Ujala Azeem";s:11:"credentials";s:67:"Doctor of Clinical Nutrition, M.Phil. Human Nutrition and Dietetics";s:12:"affiliations";s:234:"WHO, UNICEF, USAID, Nutrition International, Save the Children, Cornerstone OnDemand Foundation, Yale University, Stanford University, University of Copenhagen, University of Edinburgh, Ludwig Maximilian University of Munich Certified";}}}s:7:"reasons";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:24:"Why Patients Choose GODC";s:4:"text";s:34:"Six reasons patients stay with us.";s:5:"items";s:322:"Evidence-Based Lifestyle Medicine
Personalized Care Plans Tailored to Individual Health Goals
Focus On Disease Prevention and Long-Term Health
Patient-Centered Approach Built on Compassion and Respect
Ongoing Guidance and Support for Sustainable Lifestyle Changes
Commitment To Professional Excellence and Ethical Practice";}s:3:"cta";a:5:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:12:"Work With Us";s:5:"title";s:64:"Empowering people to make informed decisions about their health.";s:4:"text";s:162:"Whether you are looking to prevent disease, better manage an existing condition, or improve your overall health, we are here to support you every step of the way.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book a Consultation";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"a843b0f60490d8b5f12013ae35fdebb4sc";a:5:{s:5:"title";s:12:"For Patients";s:7:"summary";s:66:"Guides, resources and information for patients and their families.";s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:140:"Information for GODC patients: how to prepare for your visit, what to expect, aftercare, patient guides, resources and satisfaction results.";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:12:"For Patients";s:5:"title";s:37:"Information for patients and visitors";s:4:"text";s:188:"Access helpful tools, educational resources and expert guidance to help patients, families and caregivers understand their care and know what to expect throughout their healthcare journey.";}s:14:"children_title";s:15:"In this section";}s:34:"7d41bd63bda784bca37e86995aa68919sc";a:6:{s:5:"title";s:17:"During Your Visit";s:7:"summary";s:49:"What happens from registration to follow-up care.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:140:"What to expect during your visit to GODC: registration, consultation, nutrition and patient care, visitors, aftercare and follow-up support.";s:8:"keywords";s:68:"during your visit, clinic registration, patient care, follow-up care";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:12:"For Patients";s:5:"title";s:17:"During Your Visit";s:5:"image";s:12:"surgery.webp";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:28:"Questions before your visit?";s:4:"text";s:72:"Our friendly team is happy to help you feel confident and well prepared.";s:12:"button_label";s:16:"Contact Our Team";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"63198063c7a036af4160b7e93645f11bsc";a:8:{s:5:"title";s:18:"After Care Program";s:7:"summary";s:80:"Continuous healing, lifelong support and structured monitoring beyond treatment.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:157:"GODC After Care Program: structured follow-up consultations, health monitoring, medication review, nutrition support and lifestyle coaching beyond treatment.";s:8:"keywords";s:91:"after care program, follow-up care, recovery support, health monitoring, lifestyle coaching";}s:4:"hero";a:4:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:12:"For Patients";s:5:"title";s:18:"After Care Program";s:4:"lead";s:87:"Continuous healing, lifelong support, and advanced patient monitoring beyond treatment.";s:5:"image";s:14:"opeation-1.png";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:11:"cards_title";s:23:"Our After Care Services";s:5:"cards";a:6:{i:0;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:11:"stethoscope";s:5:"title";s:23:"Follow-Up Consultations";s:4:"text";s:40:"Regular doctor visits to track recovery.";}i:1;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:5:"chart";s:5:"title";s:17:"Health Monitoring";s:4:"text";s:39:"Advanced tracking of health indicators.";}i:2;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:4:"pill";s:5:"title";s:17:"Medication Review";s:4:"text";s:36:"Safe and optimized medication usage.";}i:3;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:5:"apple";s:5:"title";s:17:"Nutrition Support";s:4:"text";s:37:"Personalized diet plans for recovery.";}i:4;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:8:"activity";s:5:"title";s:18:"Lifestyle Coaching";s:4:"text";s:38:"Healthy habits and lifestyle training.";}i:5;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:5:"users";s:5:"title";s:19:"Specialist Guidance";s:4:"text";s:34:"Expert advice anytime you need it.";}}s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:65:"Speak to Our Clinical Support Team for your questions or queries.";s:4:"text";s:199:"Confidential discussion for patients and families, with clear explanations of treatment options and guidance whenever it is needed. Call, message or request an assessment and our team will guide you.";s:12:"button_label";s:16:"Contact Our Team";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"72465a45eb457d1e991dab362959d3a0sc";a:11:{s:5:"title";s:17:"Patient Resources";s:7:"summary";s:88:"Prepare for your consultation, know what to expect and find answers to common questions.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:163:"Patient resources at GODC: how to prepare for your consultation, what to expect, follow-up care and answers to frequently asked questions about Lifestyle Medicine.";s:8:"keywords";s:104:"patient resources, lifestyle medicine FAQ, prepare for consultation, online consultation, follow-up care";}s:4:"hero";a:5:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:17:"Patient Resources";s:5:"title";s:38:"Helping You Make the Most of Your Care";s:4:"text";s:408:"We believe that informed patients are empowered patients. Our Patient Resources are designed to help you prepare for your consultation, understand what to expect during your care, and access reliable information that supports your health journey.

Whether you are visiting us for the first time or continuing your care, we are committed to providing the guidance and resources you need every step of the way.";s:5:"image";s:10:"clinic.jpg";s:5:"links";a:4:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:"label";s:33:"Preparation for your consultation";s:6:"target";s:4:"prep";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:"label";s:14:"What to Expect";s:6:"target";s:6:"expect";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:"label";s:14:"Follow-Up Care";s:6:"target";s:8:"followup";}i:3;a:2:{s:5:"label";s:26:"Frequently Asked Questions";s:6:"target";s:4:"faqs";}}}s:4:"prep";a:5:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:17:"Before your visit";s:5:"title";s:31:"Preparing for Your Consultation";s:4:"text";s:181:"To help us provide the best possible care, please be prepared to discuss your medical history, current health concerns, medications, supplements, lifestyle habits, and health goals.";s:10:"list_title";s:35:"If available, please bring or share";s:5:"items";s:199:"Recent laboratory reports
Medical records or referral letters
Current medications and supplements
Relevant imaging or diagnostic reports
A referral letter from your primary physician, if you have one";}s:6:"expect";a:5:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:17:"During your visit";s:5:"title";s:14:"What to Expect";s:4:"text";s:116:"Your consultation is designed to provide personalized, evidence-based care tailored to your individual health needs.";s:10:"list_title";s:32:"During your appointment, we will";s:5:"items";s:321:"Review your medical and nutrition history
Discuss your current health concerns and goals
Assess lifestyle factors that may be affecting your health
Develop a personalized Lifestyle Medicine and nutrition care plan
Recommend practical, sustainable strategies to support your health
Discuss follow-up care, when appropriate";}s:8:"followup";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:14:"Follow-Up Care";s:5:"title";s:52:"Health improvement is a journey, not a single visit.";s:4:"text";s:288:"Follow-up appointments allow us to monitor your progress, evaluate your response to the care plan, and make adjustments based on your changing needs and health goals.

Regular follow-up helps ensure your care remains personalized, effective, and aligned with the latest clinical evidence.";}s:4:"faqs";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:26:"Frequently Asked Questions";s:5:"items";a:7:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:27:"What is Lifestyle Medicine?";s:6:"answer";s:297:"Lifestyle Medicine is an evidence-based medical approach that uses healthy lifestyle behaviors including nutrition, physical activity, sleep, stress management, avoidance of harmful substances, and positive social connections to help prevent, manage, and support the treatment of chronic diseases.";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:63:"How is Lifestyle Medicine different from conventional medicine?";s:6:"answer";s:543:"Conventional medicine focuses on diagnosing and treating disease with medications, procedures, and other medical treatments. Lifestyle Medicine works alongside conventional care by addressing the everyday habits that influence your health, including nutrition, physical activity, sleep, stress management, avoiding harmful substances, and maintaining healthy social connections. The goal is not only to treat disease but also to help prevent, manage, and improve chronic health conditions through sustainable, evidence-based lifestyle changes.";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:49:"What conditions can Lifestyle Medicine help with?";s:6:"answer";s:496:"Lifestyle Medicine can help prevent, manage, and support the treatment of many chronic health conditions, including:

- Type 2 Diabetes and Prediabetes
- High Blood Pressure
- Heart Disease
- High Cholesterol
- Obesity And Excess Weight
- Metabolic Syndrome
- Fatty Liver Disease
- Certain Digestive and Autoimmune Conditions
- Stress, anxiety, burnout, and chronic fatigue

It can also help reduce the risk of developing many chronic diseases and improve your overall health and quality of life.";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:29:"How do I book an appointment?";s:6:"answer";s:343:"Scheduling an appointment is easy. You can:

- Call our clinic during business hours.
- Contact us using the information on our Contact Us page.
- Book online by selecting a date and time that works best for you.

Once your appointment is scheduled, you will receive confirmation along with any instructions to help you prepare for your visit.";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:37:"How do I book an online consultation?";s:6:"answer";s:314:"Online consultations are available for both new and returning patients.

To schedule a virtual appointment, use our online booking system and select Online Consultation as your appointment type. After your appointment is confirmed, you will receive a secure link with instructions on how to join your consultation.";}i:5;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:21:"Do I need a referral?";s:6:"answer";s:230:"A referral may not be required for most consultations. However, if you are currently receiving treatment from another healthcare professional, sharing relevant medical information can help us coordinate your care more effectively.";}i:6;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:45:"How often will I need follow-up appointments?";s:6:"answer";s:177:"The frequency of follow-up depends on your health condition, treatment goals, and progress. Your clinician will recommend an appropriate schedule based on your individual needs.";}}}s:9:"education";a:6:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:17:"Patient Education";s:5:"title";s:77:"Learning about your health is an important part of achieving better outcomes.";s:4:"text";s:172:"Visit our Blog for evidence-based articles, practical health tips, and educational resources covering Lifestyle Medicine, nutrition, disease prevention, and healthy living.";s:12:"button_label";s:14:"Visit Our Blog";s:11:"button_link";s:5:"/blog";s:5:"image";s:14:"Sarcopenia.jpg";}s:3:"cta";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:28:"Ready to Take the Next Step?";s:5:"title";s:35:"Compassionate, evidence-based care.";s:4:"text";s:184:"Whether you are seeking preventive care, managing a chronic condition, or working toward a healthier lifestyle, our team is here to support you with compassionate, evidence-based care.";}s:7:"booking";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:22:"Book Your Consultation";s:4:"form";s:19:"booking-appointment";}}s:34:"35b194b8d928bf7eebfb799d93e43ab8sc";a:12:{s:5:"title";s:27:"Patient Guide & Help Centre";s:7:"summary";s:81:"Everything you need to know before, during and after your nutrition consultation.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:139:"GODC patient guide and help centre: how to prepare for your nutrition consultation, the assessment process and answers to common questions.";s:8:"keywords";s:95:"patient guide, nutrition consultation, help centre, what to bring, nutrition assessment process";}s:4:"hero";a:4:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:12:"For Patients";s:5:"title";s:27:"Patient Guide & Help Centre";s:4:"lead";s:165:"Everything you need to know before, during, and after your nutrition consultation. Our goal is to make your healthcare journey simple, comfortable, and personalized.";s:5:"image";s:10:"clinic.jpg";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:11:"cards_title";s:28:"Nutrition Assessment Process";s:5:"cards";a:4:{i:0;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:9:"clipboard";s:5:"title";s:13:"Health Review";s:4:"text";s:71:"Evaluation of your medical history, symptoms, and nutritional concerns.";}i:1;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:8:"activity";s:5:"title";s:18:"Lifestyle Analysis";s:4:"text";s:83:"Assessment of eating habits, physical activity, sleep patterns, and daily routines.";}i:2;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:5:"apple";s:5:"title";s:18:"Nutrition Planning";s:4:"text";s:81:"Creation of a personalized nutrition strategy tailored to your health objectives.";}i:3;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:5:"chart";s:5:"title";s:19:"Progress Monitoring";s:4:"text";s:89:"Regular follow-up appointments to review progress and adjust recommendations when needed.";}}s:11:"links_title";s:25:"Patient guides by service";s:5:"links";a:10:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:26:"Obesity & Metabolic Health";s:4:"link";s:38:"/our-services/obesity-metabolic-health";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:25:"Cardiometabolic Disorders";s:4:"link";s:39:"/our-services/cardiometabolic-disorders";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:23:"Cardiovascular Diseases";s:4:"link";s:37:"/our-services/cardiovascular-diseases";}i:3;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:22:"Neurological Disorders";s:4:"link";s:36:"/our-services/neurological-disorders";}i:4;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:25:"Musculoskeletal Disorders";s:4:"link";s:39:"/our-services/musculoskeletal-disorders";}i:5;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:37:"Geriatric & Palliative Care Nutrition";s:4:"link";s:49:"/our-services/geriatric-palliative-care-nutrition";}i:6;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:21:"Specialized Nutrition";s:4:"link";s:35:"/our-services/specialized-nutrition";}i:7;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:15:"Renal Disorders";s:4:"link";s:29:"/our-services/renal-disorders";}i:8;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:34:"Clinical & Critical Care Nutrition";s:4:"link";s:41:"/our-services/clinical-critical-nutrition";}i:9;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:32:"Aesthetic & Preventive Nutrition";s:4:"link";s:44:"/our-services/aesthetic-preventive-nutrition";}}s:10:"faqs_title";s:26:"Frequently Asked Questions";s:4:"faqs";a:4:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:22:"Do I need lab reports?";s:6:"answer";s:69:"Recent laboratory results can be helpful but are not always required.";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:40:"Will I receive a personalized diet plan?";s:6:"answer";s:93:"Yes, every patient receives recommendations based on their individual health needs and goals.";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:45:"How often should I schedule follow-up visits?";s:6:"answer";s:65:"Follow-up frequency depends on your condition and treatment plan.";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:38:"Can consultations be conducted online?";s:6:"answer";s:68:"Yes, virtual consultations may be available depending on your needs.";}}s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:34:"Speak to our clinical support team";s:4:"text";s:135:"Confidential discussion for patients and families, with clear explanations of your treatment options and guidance whenever you need it.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"25cc08433658092ff2f92bd02bac2cabsc";a:6:{s:5:"title";s:19:"Prior to Your Visit";s:7:"summary";s:44:"How to prepare for your appointment at GODC.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:135:"Prepare for your visit to GODC: what to bring, insurance, planning your return home and what to expect on arrival at our Lahore clinic.";s:8:"keywords";s:81:"prepare for appointment, what to bring to clinic, patient information, GODC visit";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:12:"For Patients";s:5:"title";s:19:"Prior to Your Visit";s:5:"image";s:17:"visit-patient.jpg";}s:7:"sidebar";b:1;s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:28:"Questions before your visit?";s:4:"text";s:72:"Our friendly team is happy to help you feel confident and well prepared.";s:12:"button_label";s:16:"Contact Our Team";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"fdf520931901bb65de6ef2639de586c6sc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:20:"Patient Satisfaction";s:7:"summary";s:89:"Our commitment to safe, personalised, high-quality care — measured by patient feedback.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:148:"GODC patient satisfaction results: 91.4% rated care excellent or very good, 96.6% treated with dignity and respect, 98.2% effective pain management.";s:8:"keywords";s:69:"patient satisfaction, patient feedback, GODC reviews, quality of care";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:12:"For Patients";s:5:"title";s:20:"Patient Satisfaction";s:5:"image";s:25:"Patient-Satisfaction.webp";}s:5:"intro";s:559:"At GODC, our goal is to provide every patient with exceptional healthcare, compassionate support, and the highest standards of clinical excellence. We believe that listening to our patients is essential to continually improving the quality of our services and overall patient experience.

Patient feedback is invaluable to us and helps us enhance every aspect of the care we provide. We are proud of our commitment to patient satisfaction and continuously strive to deliver safe, personalized, and high-quality healthcare for every individual who visits GODC.";s:5:"stats";a:8:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:5:"91.4%";s:5:"label";s:76:"of our patients rated the quality of care at GODC as excellent or very good.";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:5:"96.6%";s:5:"label";s:72:"of patients were treated with dignity and respect throughout their care.";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:4:"100%";s:5:"label";s:117:"of patients were clearly told who to contact with any concerns about their condition or treatment after leaving GODC.";}i:3;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:5:"93.1%";s:5:"label";s:83:"of our patients felt actively involved in decisions about their care and treatment.";}i:4;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:4:"100%";s:5:"label";s:126:"of our patients found a member of the GODC team they could talk to about any concerns, questions or worries during their care.";}i:5;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:4:"100%";s:5:"label";s:109:"of our patients felt they received clear and sufficient information about their treatment and follow-up care.";}i:6;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:5:"98.2%";s:5:"label";s:43:"rated the effectiveness of pain management.";}i:7;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:5:"96.6%";s:5:"label";s:94:"of patients rated the personalised attention and care they received as excellent or very good.";}}s:6:"review";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:24:"Please leave us a review";s:4:"text";s:119:"If you would like to share your experience about the care you received at GODC, we would be delighted to hear from you.";s:4:"form";s:6:"review";}}s:34:"abe8734b9f66a81671c0391db72a02desc";a:5:{s:5:"title";s:4:"Blog";s:7:"summary";s:91:"Evidence-based articles and practical tips on Lifestyle Medicine, nutrition and prevention.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:151:"The GODC blog: evidence-based articles on Lifestyle Medicine, nutrition, heart health, physical activity and disease prevention from our clinical team.";s:8:"keywords";s:82:"lifestyle medicine blog, nutrition articles, heart health tips, disease prevention";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:17:"Patient Education";s:5:"title";s:15:"Blog & Newsroom";s:4:"text";s:200:"Knowledge is an important part of better health. Explore reliable information, practical tips and evidence-based resources designed to help you make informed decisions about your health and lifestyle.";}s:7:"content";a:1:{s:5:"items";s:14:"@self.children";}}s:34:"c21a1165cf7912c6371a94d1cf5c699bsc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:47:"Physical Activity Can Improve Blood Circulation";s:4:"date";s:16:"2026-07-09 14:17";s:7:"summary";s:171:"Blood circulation carries oxygen and nutrients to every part of the body. Poor circulation can cause fatigue, cold hands and feet, and even serious health problems over…";s:5:"image";s:22:"Blood-Ciruclation.webp";s:8:"taxonomy";a:2:{s:8:"category";a:1:{i:0;s:18:"Lifestyle Medicine";}s:3:"tag";a:1:{i:0;s:10:"Prevention";}}s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:157:"Blood circulation carries oxygen and nutrients to every part of the body. Poor circulation can cause fatigue, cold hands and feet, and even serious health…";}s:6:"author";s:18:"GODC Clinical Team";}s:34:"0be120fde1582435c4f4065f687c68a4sc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:56:"Nutrition Is Important Part of Cardiovascular Prevention";s:4:"date";s:16:"2026-07-09 14:15";s:7:"summary";s:170:"Heart disease remains one of the leading health concerns worldwide, but many cases can be prevented through daily choices. Nutrition plays a central role in protecting…";s:5:"image";s:14:"Nutrition.webp";s:8:"taxonomy";a:2:{s:8:"category";a:1:{i:0;s:18:"Lifestyle Medicine";}s:3:"tag";a:1:{i:0;s:10:"Prevention";}}s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:156:"Heart disease remains one of the leading health concerns worldwide, but many cases can be prevented through daily choices. Nutrition plays a central role…";}s:6:"author";s:18:"GODC Clinical Team";}s:34:"55da0923e695843f7321c80f4ff4468csc";a:7:{s:5:"title";s:35:"Lifestyle Medicine for Heart Health";s:4:"date";s:16:"2026-07-08 14:12";s:7:"summary";s:162:"Lifestyle medicine is an approach to healthcare that focuses on the everyday habits and behaviours that influence long-term health. Rather than relying only on…";s:5:"image";s:23:"Lifestyle-Medicine.webp";s:8:"taxonomy";a:2:{s:8:"category";a:1:{i:0;s:18:"Lifestyle Medicine";}s:3:"tag";a:1:{i:0;s:10:"Prevention";}}s:8:"metadata";a:1:{s:11:"description";s:154:"Lifestyle medicine is an approach to healthcare that focuses on the everyday habits and behaviours that influence long-term health. Rather than relying…";}s:6:"author";s:18:"GODC Clinical Team";}s:34:"7a9418be0847bf0fdf4a7c98d285b42fsc";a:15:{s:5:"title";s:4:"Home";s:9:"seo_title";s:99:"GODC – Gillani Obesity and Diabetes Clinic, Lahore | Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani & Dr. Arooj Gillani";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:215:"GODC – Gillani Obesity and Diabetes Clinic in Lahore: Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani (bariatric, laparoscopic and diabetes surgery) and Dr. Arooj Gillani (lifestyle medicine and clinical nutrition). Book a consultation.";s:8:"keywords";s:145:"lifestyle medicine Lahore, clinical nutritionist Lahore, Dr Arooj Gillani, diabetes diet, chronic disease management, corporate wellness Pakistan";}s:4:"hero";a:9:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:44:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani · Dr Arooj Gillani";s:5:"title";s:36:"Lifestyle Medicine for Better Health";s:4:"text";s:124:"Evidence-based care that helps prevent, manage, and improve chronic health conditions through sustainable lifestyle changes.";s:5:"text2";s:524:"At GODC, Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani and Dr. Arooj Gillani partner with patients to improve their health through advanced surgical expertise and the principles of Lifestyle Medicine. Our approach combines medical expertise with personalized care to address the root causes of disease, empowering you to make lasting changes that support your long-term well-being.

Whether you are looking to prevent disease, better manage an existing condition, or improve your overall health, we are here to support you every step of the way.";s:13:"primary_label";s:19:"Book a Consultation";s:12:"primary_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";s:15:"secondary_label";s:20:"Explore Our Services";s:14:"secondary_link";s:13:"/our-services";s:5:"image";s:25:"Patient-Satisfaction.webp";}s:10:"highlights";a:4:{i:0;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:11:"stethoscope";s:5:"title";s:19:"Evidence-based care";s:4:"text";s:113:"Interventions grounded in current clinical evidence and aligned with international standards of nutritional care.";}i:1;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:9:"clipboard";s:5:"title";s:18:"Personalised plans";s:4:"text";s:118:"Every patient begins with a thorough individual assessment of diagnosis, medical history, treatment and circumstances.";}i:2;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:5:"heart";s:5:"title";s:25:"Integrated with treatment";s:4:"text";s:109:"Every nutrition protocol is developed as part of your broader medical treatment plan, not separately from it.";}i:3;a:3:{s:4:"icon";s:5:"chart";s:5:"title";s:17:"Measured progress";s:4:"text";s:72:"Progress is tracked against defined health markers throughout your care.";}}s:5:"stats";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:36:"Patient satisfaction you can measure";s:10:"link_label";s:24:"See all patient feedback";s:4:"link";s:34:"/for-patients/patient-satisfaction";s:5:"items";a:4:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:5:"91.4%";s:5:"label";s:51:"rated the quality of care as excellent or very good";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:5:"96.6%";s:5:"label";s:59:"felt treated with dignity and respect throughout their care";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:5:"93.1%";s:5:"label";s:52:"felt actively involved in decisions about their care";}i:3;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:5:"98.2%";s:5:"label";s:34:"rated pain management as effective";}}}s:3:"why";a:4:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:15:"Why choose GODC";s:5:"title";s:16:"Why Choose GODC?";s:4:"text";s:712:"At GODC, every nutrition protocol is developed as part of the patient’s broader medical treatment plan, not separately from it. Our interventions are grounded in current clinical evidence and aligned with international standards of nutritional care.

Every patient begins with a thorough individual assessment covering their diagnosis, medical history, current treatment, and personal circumstances. The nutrition plan built from that assessment is specific to them, and progress is tracked against defined health markers throughout their care.

We work at the point where nutrition and clinical medicine meet, delivering care that is precise, accountable, and built entirely around the patient in front of us.";s:5:"image";s:20:"Clinic-About-Us.webp";}s:13:"consultations";a:8:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:21:"Our Clinical Services";s:5:"title";s:46:"Comprehensive Lifestyle Medicine consultations";s:4:"text";s:245:"We provide comprehensive Lifestyle Medicine consultations to support individuals living with or at risk of chronic diseases. Our care focuses on helping patients make meaningful lifestyle changes that improve health outcomes and quality of life.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book a Consultation";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";s:10:"list_title";s:25:"Our consultation includes";s:5:"items";s:208:"Lifestyle Medicine Consultations
Preventive Health Assessments
Chronic Disease Management
Personalized Lifestyle Plans
Follow-Up Consultations and Ongoing Support
Health Education and Behavior Change Coaching";s:5:"image";s:16:"Clinic-Room.webp";}s:13:"organisations";a:6:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:22:"Care for Organizations";s:5:"title";s:46:"Healthier workplaces through clinical programs";s:4:"text";s:252:"GODC also partners with organizations to deliver Lifestyle Medicine services that support employee health and well-being. We collaborate with corporate partners to promote healthier workplaces through clinical programs tailored to organizational needs.";s:12:"button_label";s:35:"Learn More About Corporate Services";s:11:"button_link";s:32:"/our-services/corporate-wellness";s:5:"image";s:21:"Office-Wellbeing.webp";}s:9:"education";a:5:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:17:"Patient Education";s:5:"title";s:47:"Knowledge is an important part of better health";s:4:"text";s:201:"Knowledge is an important part of better health. Explore reliable information, practical tips, and evidence-based resources designed to help you make informed decisions about your health and lifestyle.";s:12:"button_label";s:14:"Visit Our Blog";s:11:"button_link";s:5:"/blog";}s:3:"cta";a:5:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:28:"Ready to Take the Next Step?";s:5:"title";s:39:"Start Your Journey Toward Better Health";s:4:"text";s:213:"Small, sustainable lifestyle changes can make a meaningful difference in your health. Whether your goal is preventing disease, improving an existing condition, or living a healthier life, our team is here to help.";s:12:"button_label";s:25:"Book a Consultation Today";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}s:7:"booking";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:22:"Book Your Consultation";s:4:"text";s:63:"Share a few details and our team will confirm your appointment.";s:4:"form";s:19:"booking-appointment";}s:7:"doctors";a:4:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:11:"Our Doctors";s:5:"title";s:35:"Meet the doctors who lead your care";s:4:"text";s:147:"Surgical expertise in obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery, together with clinical nutrition and lifestyle medicine, under one roof.";s:5:"items";a:2:{i:0;a:1:{s:4:"page";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";}i:1;a:1:{s:4:"page";s:36:"/our-doctors/dr-arooj-fatima-gillani";}}}s:9:"spotlight";a:6:{s:4:"page";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";s:7:"eyebrow";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:5:"title";s:54:"Bariatric, laparoscopic and diabetes surgery in Lahore";s:4:"text";s:212:"With more than 25 years of experience in surgery, Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani provides personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care, from non-surgical weight management to metabolic surgery.";s:12:"button_label";s:29:"Meet Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:11:"button_link";s:30:"/our-doctors/dr-mohsin-gillani";}s:8:"surgical";a:4:{s:5:"group";s:35:"Surgical, Bariatric & Diabetes Care";s:7:"eyebrow";s:25:"Surgical & metabolic care";s:5:"title";s:51:"Obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery";s:4:"text";s:66:"Services led by Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani at his Johar Town clinic.";}}s:34:"e42078f94c6397810a01443b4c6270cdsc";a:5:{s:5:"title";s:6:"Robots";s:7:"visible";b:0;s:8:"routable";b:1;s:6:"robots";s:7:"noindex";s:7:"sitemap";a:1:{s:6:"ignore";b:1;}}s:34:"c78d1d363e804ed604a48f6dd06e621bsc";a:6:{s:5:"title";s:11:"Our Doctors";s:4:"menu";s:11:"Our Doctors";s:7:"summary";s:44:"Meet the doctors leading care at our centre.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:179:"Meet our doctors: Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani, advanced laparoscopic, bariatric and diabetes surgeon, and Dr. Arooj Fatima Gillani, critical care physician and clinical nutritionist.";s:8:"keywords";s:103:"Prof Dr Mohsin Gillani, Dr Arooj Fatima Gillani, bariatric surgeon Lahore, clinical nutritionist Lahore";}s:4:"hero";a:3:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:11:"Our Doctors";s:5:"title";s:33:"Expert doctors, personalised care";s:4:"text";s:147:"Surgical expertise in obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery, together with clinical nutrition and lifestyle medicine, under one roof.";}s:14:"children_title";s:18:"Choose your doctor";}s:34:"0dcdafcfbd8db731b5d8844e0189917csc";a:15:{s:5:"title";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"menu";s:17:"Dr Mohsin Gillani";s:8:"featured";b:1;s:9:"seo_title";s:79:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani | Bariatric, Laparoscopic & Diabetes Surgeon in Lahore";s:7:"summary";s:124:"Consultant advanced laparoscopic, bariatric (obesity) and metabolic diabetes surgeon in Lahore with 25+ years of experience.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:150:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani: advanced laparoscopic, bariatric (obesity) and diabetes surgeon in Lahore with 25+ years of experience. Book an appointment.";s:8:"keywords";s:121:"Prof Dr Mohsin Gillani, bariatric surgeon Lahore, obesity surgery, diabetes surgeon, advanced laparoscopic surgeon, ALCOS";}s:7:"profile";a:7:{s:4:"name";s:24:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"role";s:51:"Advanced Laparoscopic, Bariatric & Diabetes Surgeon";s:7:"tagline";s:37:"Bariatric · Laparoscopic · Diabetes";s:5:"image";s:15:"baner-image.png";s:10:"card_image";s:20:"baner-image-card.png";s:3:"bio";s:95:"Consultant advanced laparoscopic, bariatric (obesity) and metabolic diabetes surgeon in Lahore.";s:5:"chips";s:101:"Bariatric (obesity) surgery
