Cancer surgery";}s:5:"stats";a:3:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:3:"25+";s:5:"label";s:30:"Years of experience in surgery";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:5:"ALCOS";s:5:"label";s:30:"Director, Iqra Medical Complex";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:"value";s:3:"CEO";s:5:"label";s:86:"Scandinavian Obesity and Diabetes Clinic, Omar Hospital and Cardiac Centre, Johar Town";}}s:5:"quote";a:2:{s:4:"text";s:170:"My passion is to transfer basic surgical, basic laparoscopic and advanced laparoscopic skills to the upcoming / future surgeons in the form of hands-on surgical training.";s:6:"author";s:31:"Professor Doctor Mohsin Gillani";}s:15:"specialisations";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:18:"My specializations";s:4:"text";s:61:"I have more than 25 years experience in the field of surgery.";s:5:"items";a:3:{i:0;a:4:{s:5:"title";s:32:"Consultant Advanced Laparoscopic";s:4:"text";s:149:"The only specialist center in Lahore providing personalized weight management solutions along with cancer and other advanced laparoscopic procedures.";s:5:"image";s:18:"New-Project-39.jpg";s:4:"link";s:19:"/our-services/alcos";}i:1;a:4:{s:5:"title";s:18:"Metabolic Diabetes";s:4:"text";s:189:"It is a group of metabolic diseases characterized by increased levels of glucose in the blood (hyperglycemia), resulting from defects in either or both Insulin production or Insulin action.";s:5:"image";s:18:"New-Project-40.jpg";s:4:"link";s:27:"/our-services/diabetes-care";}i:2;a:4:{s:5:"title";s:27:"Bariatric (Obesity) Surgeon";s:4:"text";s:177:"Obesity is a chronic and severe condition of overweight. It can be caused by a number of elements. The international standard for measuring obesity is the BMI (Body Mass Index).";s:5:"image";s:18:"New-Project-41.jpg";s:4:"link";s:29:"/our-services/obesity-surgery";}}}s:3:"why";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:25:"Why you should choose me?";s:5:"items";s:268:"I have more than 25 years experience in the field of surgery.
CEO of Scandinavian Obesity and Diabetes Clinic at Omar Hospital and Cardiac Centre Johar Town, Lahore.
Director of advanced laparoscopic, cancer and obesity surgery (ALCOS) at Iqra Medical Complex, Lahore.";}s:5:"intro";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:16:"About the clinic";s:4:"text";s:470:"Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani is the only specialized Doctor in Pakistan providing wide range of personalized Obesity and Diabetes management solutions.

It not only treat the existing obesity and diabetes but also deal with their complications with the help of various latest modalities. Further it also has a preventive medical department who guide the potential individual who have a strong family history of Obesity and Diabetes to avoid these chronic diseases in future.";s:6:"points";a:2:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:6:"Vision";s:4:"text";s:89:"To treat obesity & Diabetes along with their complications and to prevent them in future.";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:7:"Mission";s:4:"text";s:117:"To develop a center of excellence where skill and knowledge can be shared in order to help the society at its maximum";}}}s:10:"commitment";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:14:"Our commitment";s:4:"text";s:636:"Our commitment is to give back the full enjoyment of life to our patients, no matter in which stage the patient is, along with the personalized attention and adequate integral treatment for each patient, together we’ll achieve a constant and long-lasting weight loss. Diabetes Obesity Clinic will always be the best option for you.

It’s certain that a definite solution exists for each individual that struggles with an overweight problem. Starting with a clinical analysis of weight, clinical history, actual health status in order to achieve the patient’s goals. The treatment is personalized and adequate our patient’s needs";}s:6:"clinic";a:8:{s:7:"eyebrow";s:10:"Our clinic";s:5:"title";s:60:"Visit our new facility. We're looking forward to seeing you!";s:7:"address";s:76:"4, 25, 26 Maulana Shaukat Ali Rd, Block A Phase 1 Johar Town, Lahore, Punjab";s:5:"hours";s:22:"Mon - Sat: 9 AM - 6 PM";s:5:"phone";s:12:"042 35174502";s:5:"email";s:25:"drmohsingillani@gmail.com";s:8:"map_link";s:88:"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Maulana+Shaukat+Ali+Rd+Johar+Town+Lahore";s:5:"image";s:10:"clinic.jpg";}s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:49:"Book a consultation with Prof. Dr. Mohsin Gillani";s:4:"text";s:80:"Personalised obesity, diabetes and advanced laparoscopic surgery care in Lahore.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book an Appointment";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}s:34:"3b85a64c1d958e25670debea13dadd00sc";a:10:{s:5:"title";s:23:"Dr Arooj Fatima Gillani";s:4:"menu";s:23:"Dr Arooj Fatima Gillani";s:7:"summary";s:95:"Critical Care Physician, Anesthesiologist and Consultant Clinical & Critical Care Nutritionist.";s:8:"metadata";a:2:{s:11:"description";s:215:"Dr. Arooj Fatima Gillani — Critical Care Physician, Anesthesiologist and clinical nutritionist (MBBS, MSc Public Health & Nutrition, FCPS Anesthesiology). Lifestyle medicine and clinical nutrition at GODC, Lahore.";s:8:"keywords";s:123:"Dr Arooj Fatima Gillani, clinical nutritionist Lahore, critical care nutrition, anesthesiologist, lifestyle medicine doctor";}s:7:"profile";a:6:{s:4:"name";s:23:"Dr Arooj Fatima Gillani";s:4:"role";s:41:"Critical Care Physician, Anesthesiologist";s:5:"image";s:27:"Dr-Arooj-Fatima-Gillani.jpg";s:7:"tagline";s:39:"Lifestyle Medicine & Clinical Nutrition";s:3:"bio";s:170:"Critical care physician, anesthesiologist and clinical nutritionist dedicated to critical care, palliative and geriatric nutrition, and evidence-based Lifestyle Medicine.";s:5:"chips";s:106:"Lifestyle Medicine
Clinical & critical care nutrition
Geriatric & palliative nutrition
Diabetes management";}s:9:"education";a:2:{s:5:"title";s:20:"Training & Education";s:5:"items";a:4:{i:0;a:3:{s:6:"degree";s:4:"MBBS";s:11:"institution";s:32:"Baqai Medical University Karachi";s:4:"logo";s:33:"Baqai_Medical_University_logo.png";}i:1;a:3:{s:6:"degree";s:36:"MSc. Professional Global Development";s:11:"institution";s:27:"Coventry University England";s:4:"logo";s:45:"coventry-university-logo-removebg-preview.png";}i:2;a:3:{s:6:"degree";s:30:"MSc. Public Health & Nutrition";s:11:"institution";s:27:"Coventry University England";s:4:"logo";s:45:"coventry-university-logo-removebg-preview.png";}i:3;a:3:{s:6:"degree";s:27:"F.C.P.S.-I (Anesthesiology)";s:11:"institution";s:43:"College of Physicians and Surgeons Pakistan";s:4:"logo";s:48:"College_of_Physicians__Surgeons_Pakistanlogo.png";}}}s:5:"intro";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:12:"Introduction";s:4:"text";s:303:"Dr. Arooj Fatima Gillani is a specialized clinical nutritionist dedicated to critical care, palliative, and geriatric nutrition. Her practice seamlessly bridges evidence-based nutritional science with pharmacological and lifestyle interventions to accelerate patient recovery and drive disease reversal.";s:6:"points";a:3:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:27:"Advanced Clinical Protocols";s:4:"text";s:137:"Expert implementation of ERAS (Enhanced Recovery After Surgery) protocols, metabolic syndrome reversal, and geriatric oncology nutrition.";}i:1;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:27:"Complex Nutritional Support";s:4:"text";s:138:"Highly experienced in both enteral feeding (including PEG, RIG, gastrostomy, and J-tube) and total/partial parenteral nutrition (TPN/PPN).";}i:2;a:2:{s:5:"title";s:25:"Patient-Centered Outcomes";s:4:"text";s:106:"Focused on clinical rehabilitation and collaborative, multidisciplinary care to optimize patient recovery.";}}}s:8:"services";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:8:"Services";s:4:"text";s:344:"As a Consultant Clinical and Critical Care Nutritionist, Dr. Arooj Fatima Gillani seamlessly integrates advanced medical nutrition therapy into the core medical services. Her specialized expertise in critical care nutrition and complex feeding modalities (enteral and parenteral) directly supports patients undergoing Intensive Care Management.";s:5:"items";s:115:"Diabetes Management
Family Medicine
Lifestyle Medicine
Intensive Care Management
Mental Health Treatment
Spirometry";}s:10:"experience";a:3:{s:5:"title";s:10:"Experience";s:4:"text";s:344:"As a Consultant Clinical and Critical Care Nutritionist, Dr. Arooj Fatima Gillani seamlessly integrates advanced medical nutrition therapy into the core medical services. Her specialized expertise in critical care nutrition and complex feeding modalities (enteral and parenteral) directly supports patients undergoing Intensive Care Management.";s:4:"rows";a:2:{i:0;a:4:{s:5:"years";s:11:"2007 - 2021";s:10:"department";s:23:"Nutrition and Dietetics";s:8:"position";s:10:"Consultant";s:8:"hospital";s:41:"National Hospital & Medical Centre Lahore";}i:1;a:4:{s:5:"years";s:11:"2021 - 2023";s:10:"department";s:23:"Nutrition and Dietetics";s:8:"position";s:28:"Head of Nutrition Department";s:8:"hospital";s:41:"National Hospital & Medical Centre Lahore";}}}s:3:"cta";a:4:{s:5:"title";s:25:"Consult Dr. Arooj Gillani";s:4:"text";s:121:"Book an in-person or online consultation for personalised, evidence-based clinical nutrition and lifestyle medicine care.";s:12:"button_label";s:19:"Book a Consultation";s:11:"button_link";s:20:"/book-a-consultation";}}}s:5:"files";a:56:{s:48:"/Users/amer/Sites/godc/user/pages/forms/forms.md";a:4:{i:0;i:1793723851;i:1;i:12786;i:2;s:34:"5f2c07d209be89857b221d368aed6262sc";i:3;i:1793734131;}s:59:"/Users/amer/Sites/godc/user/pages/privacy-policy/article.md";a:4:{i:0;i:1793723851;i:1;i:1761;i:2;s:34:"0e25d4667c6ea0efec58009988cb2668sc";i:3;i:1793734131;}s:61:"/Users/amer/Sites/godc/user/pages/04.our-services/services.md";a:4:{i:0;i:1793723851;i:1;i:24731;i:2;s:34:"74633560f7b1b72c775b48e5d3d6dae7sc";i:3;i:1793734131;}s:93:"/Users/amer/Sites/godc/user/pages/04.our-services/20.clinical-critical-nutrition/condition.md";a:4:{i:0;i:1793723851;i:1;i:7981;i:2;s:34:"015ee897037aa0e00a13bd009c5ad4b8sc";i:3;i:1793734131;}s:84:"/Users/amer/Sites/godc/user/pages/04.our-services/11.lifestyle-medicine/lifestyle.md";a:4:{i:0;i:1793723851;i:1;i:5424;i:2;s:34:"fff98bbdc135ae0f41985a5683